		<h3>Daily Fiction</h3>
		<h1>First Summer</h1>
		<h2>By  Ekin Oklap</h2>
		<div class="img-excerpt-container">
			<div class="img-container"><img src="https://s26162.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/first-summer-9781668225790_lg.jpg" alt="First Summer"></div>
			<div class="excerpt-container"><div class="excerpt"><em>The following is from Ekin Oklap's debut novel, </em>First Summer<em>. Oklap was born in Turkey, grew up in Italy, and lives in London. Her translations from Turkish and Italian have been shortlisted for the International Booker Prize and John Florio Prize, among others.</em></div></div>
		</div>
